# Pairs with GateOwnership. The move-away marker is written only under C's split gate.
MODULE: ConsolidationSkipsAdmission
TARGET: GateOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the consolidation turn holds C's split gate before it is admitted or takes the gate
PERTURBS: BeginConsolidation

--- FIND
    /\ cons = "idle"
    /\ cons' = "queued"
--- REPLACE
    /\ cons = "idle"
    \* MUTATION: the turn skips admission and the gate
    /\ cons' = "holding"
--- END
